    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 06 How it works (soft band): seven stages and the five actions -->
  <section class="section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-mark"><span class="numeral">06</span><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p></div>
        <h2 id="how-title">From Prompt to Project in Seven Stages.</h2>
        <p class="subcopy">CuTTI is an MCP server: it gives an AI assistant a defined set of Logic Pro tools and coordinates them as verified actions. MCP is the open standard for connecting AI assistants to tools.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="lp-flow" role="list">
        <li class="lp-stage"><span class="numeral">01</span><h3 class="h4">Producer Prompt</h3><p>You describe the song: genre, mood, tempo, instruments and structure, in plain words.</p></li>
        <li class="lp-stage"><span class="numeral">02</span><h3 class="h4">Intent &amp; Template Parser</h3><p>Understands the intent and extracts structure, genre, instruments and style.</p></li>
        <li class="lp-stage"><span class="numeral">03</span><h3 class="h4">SongPlan &amp; Arrangement Engine</h3><p>Creates a song structure with sections, a track plan and the musical decisions behind it.</p></li>
        <li class="lp-stage"><span class="numeral">04</span><h3 class="h4">Genre &amp; Instrument Knowledge Base</h3><p>Styles, instruments, idioms and arrangement patterns for rich, realistic results.</p></li>
        <li class="lp-stage"><span class="numeral">05</span><h3 class="h4">MCP Orchestrator</h3><p>Coordinates tools, planning and execution, one verified action at a time.</p></li>
        <li class="lp-stage"><span class="numeral">06</span><h3 class="h4">Logic Pro Automation Layer</h3><p>Turns the plan into a real Logic Pro project through Logic Pro's own actions.</p></li>
        <li class="lp-stage lp-stage--out"><span class="numeral">07</span><h3 class="h4">Editable Logic Pro Project</h3><p>A fully arranged project opened in Logic Pro. Tweak it, mix it and make it yours.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="lp-actions">
        <p class="eyebrow">What the automation layer does</p>
        <ul class="chips" role="list">
          <li class="chip">MIDI generation</li>
          <li class="chip">Arrangement templates</li>
          <li class="chip">Track creation</li>
          <li class="chip">Section edits</li>
          <li class="chip">Project save and bounce</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 07 Producer in the loop (dark band) -->
  <section class="section band-dark" id="control" aria-labelledby="control-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-mark"><span class="numeral">07</span><p class="eyebrow">Producer in the loop</p></div>
        <h2 id="control-title">Your DAW. Your Templates. <span class="key">Your Control.</span></h2>
        <p class="subcopy">The same rule we apply to governed agents in the enterprise: the agent acts through defined, verified tools, and a person makes the decisions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hgrid hgrid--3 hgrid--bottom">
        <div class="control">
          <h3>Producer in the Loop</h3>
          <p class="control__body">CuTTI proposes and builds. You decide what stays, what changes and what the song becomes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="control">
          <h3>Original Arrangements</h3>
